<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Deployer | Runtime Modularity Platform</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #0f172a;
      --surface-color: #1e293b;
      --primary-color: #38bdf8;
      /* Sky Blue */
      --accent-color: #22d3ee;
      /* Cyan */
      --text-primary: #f8fafc;
      --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
      --success: #4ade80;
      --font-main: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Utilities */
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 32px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--accent-color));
      color: #0f172a;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 1px solid var(--text-secondary);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 24px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      padding: 100px 0;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #94a3b8);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    /* Animation Concept: Coupling */
    .module-demo {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 60px;
      height: 100px;
    }

    .core,
    .module {
      height: 60px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .core {
      width: 150px;
      background: var(--surface-color);
      border: 2px solid var(--text-secondary);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .module {
      width: 100px;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
      border: 2px dashed var(--primary-color);
      color: var(--primary-color);
      animation: couple 3s infinite ease-in-out;
      position: relative;
    }

    @keyframes couple {
      0% {
        transform: translateX(40px);
        opacity: 0.5;
      }

      50% {
        transform: translateX(-10px);
        opacity: 1;
        background: var(--primary-color);
        color: #000;
        border-style: solid;
      }

      100% {
        transform: translateX(40px);
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
    }

    /* Features */
    .features {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: var(--surface-color);
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--bg-color);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .card-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Terminal Preview */
    .terminal-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .terminal {
      background: #000;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid #333;
    }

    .terminal-header {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .dot.red {
      background: #ef4444;
    }

    .dot.yellow {
      background: #eab308;
    }

    .dot.green {
      background: #22c55e;
    }

    .code-line {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: block;
    }

    .prompt {
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .cmd {
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    .output {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing {
      padding: 80px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .price-card {
      background: var(--surface-color);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      position: relative;
    }

    .price-card.featured {
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);
    }

    .price-card.featured::after {
      content: 'MAIS POPULAR';
      position: absolute;
      top: -12px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--primary-color);
      color: #0f172a;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .price span {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .features-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 30px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .features-list li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .features-list li::before {
      content: '✓';
      color: var(--success);
      margin-right: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      padding: 40px 0;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <div class="logo">apps<span>.deployer</span></div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#features">Recursos</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">Como Funciona</a>
          <a href="#pricing">Planos</a>
          <a href="#docs">Docs</a>
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-left: 20px; padding: 8px 20px;">Entrar</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Acople e Desacople Módulos<br>em Tempo de Execução.</h1>
      <p>O motor de orquestração definitivo para a plataforma Apps. Atualize lógicas de negócio, integre micro-frontends
        e gerencie plugins sem downtime.</p>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn-primary">Começar Agora</a>
        <a href="#docs" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-left: 10px;">Ler Documentação</a>
      </div>

      <div class="module-demo">
        <div class="core">CORE APP</div>
        <div class="module">MODULE</div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--text-secondary);">Hot-swapping ativo</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="features" class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Modularidade sem limites</h2>
        <p>Construído para arquiteturas distribuídas e escaláveis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Hot Swapping</h3>
          <p>Substitua partes da sua aplicação enquanto ela roda. Ideal para correções críticas e A/B testing
            instantâneo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Isolamento Seguro</h3>
          <p>Cada módulo roda em sandbox. Se um módulo falhar, o core da sua aplicação continua intacto e operante.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🔌</div>
          <h3>API Universal</h3>
          <p>Compatível com React, Vue, Node.js e Python. Uma interface padrão para acoplar qualquer stack.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="terminal-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Integração via CLI</h2>
        <p>Simples como um comando.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-header">
          <div class="dot red"></div>
          <div class="dot yellow"></div>
          <div class="dot green"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="code-line">
          <span class="prompt">user@apps:~$</span> <span class="cmd">deployer module:attach --src ./payment-v2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-line">
          <span class="output">> Verificando compatibilidade... OK</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-line">
          <span class="output">> Acoplando módulo 'payment-v2' ao Core...</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-line">
          <span class="output" style="color: var(--success);">> Módulo acoplado com sucesso (Runtime: 12ms)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="code-line">
          <span class="prompt">user@apps:~$</span> <span class="cmd">_</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" class="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Assinatura Deployer</h2>
        <p>Escolha a capacidade de orquestração que seu projeto precisa.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Starter</h3>
          <div class="price">R$ 0<span>/mês</span></div>
          <p>Para projetos pessoais e testes.</p>
          <ul class="features-list">
            <li>Até 3 Módulos simultâneos</li>
            <li>CLI Básico</li>
            <li>Logs de retenção 24h</li>
            <li>Suporte da Comunidade</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%">Criar Conta Grátis</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card featured">
          <h3>Pro</h3>
          <div class="price">R$ 149<span>/mês</span></div>
          <p>Para equipes que precisam de escala.</p>
          <ul class="features-list">
            <li>Módulos Ilimitados</li>
            <li>Rollback Automático</li>
            <li>Dashboard de Métricas</li>
            <li>Suporte Prioritário</li>
            <li>SLA 99.9%</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%">Assinar Pro</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Enterprise</h3>
          <div class="price">Sob Consulta</div>
          <p>Para arquiteturas de missão crítica.</p>
          <ul class="features-list">
            <li>Deploy Híbrido (On-premise)</li>
            <li>Auditoria de Segurança</li>
            <li>Gerente de Conta Dedicado</li>
            <li>SLA Personalizado</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%">Falar com Vendas</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-logo">apps.ci.dev.br</div>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Apps Platform. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <a href="#" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 10px; text-decoration: none;">Status</a>
        <a href="#" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 10px; text-decoration: none;">Privacidade</a>
        <a href="/terms" style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 10px; text-decoration: none;">Termos</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>

</html>